# Runtime file-store — recreated by loop/request; never versioned.
/db/

# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores any `.claude/` directory anywhere
# in the tree (container-owned state at the app root). This tool's own
# `.claude/` is versioned config (slash commands, project settings), not
# runtime state — un-ignore it here.
!/.claude/
!/.claude/**
